  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Frontends",
      "items": [
        "Both proxies read FASTRAG_API_URL and a server-only FASTRAG_QUERY_TOKEN and reject paths outside an allowlist (404)",
        "website allows uploads/deletes; the console proxies only GET/POST and also fetches /v1/strategies server-side, bypassing its proxy",
        "The website keeps the last 10 query traces in sessionStorage for the /query trace page"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Index writers",
      "items": [
        "Offline scripts build a kb_<version> collection, register it in Postgres and flip the kb_current alias (or defer with --no-activate)",
        "The RQ worker does the same for admin rebuilds, but only in the compose stack — hosted deployments have no worker",
        "Session uploads are written by the API into the live collection with session_upload=true"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Config at startup",
      "items": [
        "calibration.json comes from the file or FASTRAG_CALIBRATION_JSON; the corpus centroid from the file or the active manifest row",
        "Readiness fails on a fingerprint, content_version or centroid-dimension mismatch"
      ]
    }
  ]
